      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SNEAKY PHILTRA (8) worked to find the lead but couldn't keep going and finished second last start over 2240m at Swan Hill, that effort coming after a nice win at this track the run prior. Drawn to enjoy a nice run, with luck possibly playing a role at some point. Perfectly placed and is sure to play a major role. PUNTO CALIENTE (3) is in good form at present. Finished fourth at his latest appearance over 2240m at Swan Hill, beaten 4 metres. Has the benefit of a good draw. Tackles a similar assignment and he can grab that well-deserved win. DAYLIGHT (10) comes right into contention after scoring last start by 19 metres at this track over 2190m. BURNING HOT (1) is the best of the rest after finishing fourth over 1609m at Port Pirie last time out.",
